---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const baseURL = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="소개 — sepn0r" description="김요셉 — 주니어 개발자 & AI 강사 소개">
  <section class="fade-in flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-8 sm:gap-12">
    <img
      src={`${baseURL}/images/profile.png`}
      alt="김요셉 프로필 사진"
      class="w-32 h-32 sm:w-40 sm:h-40 rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-lg shadow-neutral-200/50"
    />
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight">김요셉</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        주니어 개발자이자 AI 강사로서,<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        생성형 AI 활용 교육과 연구를 하고 있습니다.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="mt-16 space-y-16 fade-in fade-in-delay-2">

    <!-- Education -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-8">Education</h2>
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900">한국기술교육대학교 대학원</h3>
            <span class="text-sm text-neutral-400">2025.03 ~ 현재</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-500">석사 과정 · 컴퓨터공학과 · <a href="https://ngnlab.koreatech.ac.kr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-900 transition-colors">NGN Lab</a></p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed">연구 주제: 멀티 모달 입력 간 언어 일관성</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900">한국기술교육대학교</h3>
            <span class="text-sm text-neutral-400">2019.03 ~ 2025.02</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-500">학사 · 컴퓨터공학부 · GPA 3.32</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-500 leading-relaxed">홍보대사 나래 15기 회장, 학생회 총무부장, 학부 연구생</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900">경기모바일과학고등학교</h3>
            <span class="text-sm text-neutral-400">2016.03 ~ 2019.02</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-500">모바일콘텐츠과</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Teaching -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-8">Teaching</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-6">2025년 기업·공공기관 대상 생성형 AI 활용 강의 20회 이상 진행</p>
      <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {[
          { org: 'KPC 한국생산성본부', topic: 'AI for Biz 원데이 클래스' },
          { org: 'KMA 한국능률협회', topic: 'ChatGPT 마스터 클래스' },
          { org: '한국도로교통공단', topic: 'AI 활용 행정업무 혁신' },
          { org: '한국지역난방공사', topic: 'AI 활용 교육' },
          { org: '한기대 평생교육원', topic: 'AI 이미지 생성 · AI for Biz' },
          { org: '대구가톨릭대학교', topic: 'AI 이미지&영상 생성' },
          { org: '중소벤처기업연수원', topic: 'AI 활용 교육' },
          { org: '한국장애인공단', topic: 'OA 강의' },
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/50 px-5 py-4">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-neutral-900">{item.org}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-neutral-500">{item.topic}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Work -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-8">Experience</h2>
      <div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900">인트레피드 컨트롤 시스템즈 코리아</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-neutral-400">2024.12 ~ 2025.01</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-500">인턴 · 차량 통신 기술 지원</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Research -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-8">Research</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/50 px-6 py-5">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">한국항행학회</p>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-neutral-900 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-white">논문지</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">2026.02</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">CLIP 기반 검색 시스템을 위한 사후 임베딩 PCA 경량화 연구</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-neutral-400">김요셉, 박병주, 유연휘, 한주현, 문일영 · J. Adv. Navig. Technol. 30(1): 41-47</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/50 px-6 py-5">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">한국항행학회</p>
              <span class="rounded-full border border-neutral-300 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500">학술대회</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">2025</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">항공영상 캡셔닝에서 연산 데이터 타입별 성능-자원 효율성 비교</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-neutral-400">김요셉, 박병주, 유연휘, 한주현, 문일영 · Qwen2.5-VL, RSICD 데이터셋</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/50 px-6 py-5">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">한국정보통신학회</p>
              <span class="rounded-full border border-neutral-300 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500">학술대회</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">2025</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">비전-언어 모델(VLM) 연구에서 한국어 자원의 중요성과 기술 분석</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-neutral-400">김요셉, 박병주, 문일영 · CLIP, BLIP, KoLLaVA, VARCO-VISION</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/50 px-6 py-5">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">한국항행학회</p>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-neutral-900 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-white">논문지</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">2024.12</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">강화학습 기반 자율주행 시스템에서 GAN 기반 데이터 증강 연구</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-neutral-400">박병주, 김요셉, 문일영 · J. Adv. Navig. Technol. 28(6): 979-985</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/50 px-6 py-5 ring-1 ring-neutral-200">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">한국항행학회</p>
              <span class="rounded-full border border-neutral-300 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500">학술대회</span>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-neutral-900 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-white">우수논문상</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">2024.10</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">GAN기반 데이터 증강을 통한 복잡한 환경에서의 객체 인식 성능 개선 연구</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-neutral-400">박병주, 김요셉, 문일영 · CycleGAN, YOLOv8</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/50 px-6 py-5">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">한국실천공학교육학회</p>
              <span class="rounded-full border border-neutral-300 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500">학술대회</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">2024</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">지역별 데이터셋을 활용한 자율주행 객체 인식 모델 성능의 비교 분석</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-neutral-400">김요셉, 박병주, 문일영 · YOLOv8, AIHUB, BDD100K</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50/50 px-6 py-5">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">IEEE i-CoSTe</p>
              <span class="rounded-full border border-neutral-300 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-500">국제학회</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">2024</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">A Study on Object Detection Performance through Data Augmentation under Adverse Weather Conditions</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-neutral-400">YoSep Kim, ByeongJu Park, Il-Young Moon · YOLOv8, Faster R-CNN, SSD</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Military -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-8">Military</h2>
      <div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between gap-1">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900">대한민국 육군</h3>
          <span class="text-sm text-neutral-400">2020.01 ~ 2022.02</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-500">하사 · 수송 · 만기제대</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-8">Contact</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/SepYoKim6745"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-neutral-300 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-600 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-900 hover:shadow-sm"
        >
          GitHub &nearr;
        </a>
        <a
          href="mailto:gkfhak123@gmail.com"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-neutral-300 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-600 transition-all duration-200 hover:border-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-900 hover:shadow-sm"
        >
          Email &nearr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
